        ai_summary:
          "Novartis reported high single-digit sales growth and a 40% core margin in 2025, with a 14% increase in core operating income. Sales were driven by strong performances from brands like Kisqali, Kesimpta, Pluvicto, Scemblix, and Cosentyx. Net sales grew by 8%, and core operating income margin reached 40.1%. Operating income increased by 25%, and net income rose by 19%. Free cash flow was USD 17.6 billion. The fourth quarter saw a 1% sales decline due to US generic erosion. Key milestones included FDA submissions for Remibrutinib, Pelabresib, and Pluvicto, and EC approval for Scemblix. A dividend increase to CHF 3.70 per share was proposed for 2025-2026.",
